OL,3,GNEWSAHow has community reacted to major
OL,4,Adata centre plan?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe demand for new data centres could
OL,7,Flead to one of the biggest in the
OL,8,Fcountry, being built in a rural Fenland
OL,9,Fvillage.
OL,11,FEvolution Power Limited (EPL) revealed
OL,12,Fon Thursday it wants to create the
OL,13,Ffacility on farmland near Tilney St
OL,14,FLawrence, a few miles from King's Lynn.
OL,16,FIt would require up to one gigawatt
OL,17,F(GW) of power at any given time and the
OL,18,Ffirm also wants to build a large solar
OL,19,Ffarm that would generate up to 1.3GW,
OL,20,Fto support it.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
