OL,3,GNEWSAHow has community reacted to major
OL,4,Adata centre plan?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme, named Longmarsh Green
OL,7,FEnergy, is already causing concern,
OL,8,Fwith residents saying they have been
OL,9,Fleft "shocked" by the scale of the
OL,10,Fsite. Here is what we know so far.
